  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday night through Saturday)\nIssued at 205 AM CST Sun Nov 1 2026\n\nThe trough pushes east on Tuesday sending a weak cold front into\nthe CWA. Temperatures drop back down only to near normal where\nthey will continue through the end of the week. The upper pattern\nis zonal and any systems moving across the country will be weak\nand fast moving moving from west to east. The lack of any systems\nmoving down out of Canada prevents any strong cold air intrusion\nfor our forecast period.\n\nHennig",
